[[File:Mandel zoom 00 mandelbrot set.jpg|right|thumb|Initial image of a Mandelbrot set zoom sequence with a continuously colored environment.]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics}} the [[set]] of [[complex number]]s ''c'' for which the [[orbit]] of 0 under [[iteration]] of the [[complex]] [[quadratic]] [[polynomial]] ''z''<sub>''n''+1</sub> = ''z''<sub>''n''</sub><sup>2</sup> + ''c'' remains [[bounded]]. The [[boundary]] of this set is a [[fractal]].

